  "vibe": "A chess club on a parchment table. #efe6d8 board tone under DM Serif Display, walnut #6b4a2f for the furniture, and a single brick red #b3452e for whatever is under attack. The world draws a translucent 5×5 board into the bottom-right corner and hops a red knight between four squares in a genuine arc, while an analogue clock top-left runs one fast red hand against one slow ink hand and ♟ ♞ ♛ glyphs light in rotation along the base. The montage grid is the only one here with zero tilt — every tile sits square, radius 8, like a printed scoresheet. Statement beats invert to near-black #221c16; the CTA goes full walnut. Titles settle slowly while items flip in like turned cards. Owns a board Scroll, check Toggles, a typewriter Typing pass and split-flap Morphs. For clubs, leagues, courses, bookshops — anything cerebral and unhurried.",
